      "artist": "Geof Sheppard",
      "description": "The sea wall north of Dawlish station was breached on 4 February 2014. Although work had progressed sufficiently by April 4 to allow train services to resume, the footpath between Dawlish and Dawlish Warren remained closed at that time.",
