      "description": "A CrossCountry high speed train (powered by 43378 and 43304) slowly passes the partly rebuilt sea wall at Dawlish with the 07:07 Edinburgh to Plymouth. On the northbound line is First Great Western's 143612 and 153373 heading from Paignton to Exmouth with a local stopping service.",
